      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve the source audit record shape**\n\nWhen existing source `AdminAuditLog` rows are migrated—or later ADMIN actions audit entities other than listings—this table cannot represent the documented source contract in `apps/worker/docs/postgres-d1-map.md:11`: it omits `entityType`, nullable `entityId`, and JSON `metadata`, while making `listingId` and `targetOwnerId` mandatory. That forces migration code to discard or coerce audit history and prevents generic ADMIN events from being recorded; mirror the source nullability and structured metadata, including JSON validation, before treating this as the ADMIN audit migration.\n\nAGENTS.md reference: [AGENTS.md:L127-L127](https://github.com/sjo1848/alquileres-uspa-cloudflare/blob/cbe1066ef488073ca2ebca297e5eed8a4ad0c616/AGENTS.md#L127-L127)\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
