      "line": 79,
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Index the moderation queue ordering**\n\nWith migrations 0001–0008 applied, SQLite reports `SCAN l` and `USE TEMP B-TREE FOR ORDER BY` for this exact queue query because no index supports the pending-state predicate followed by `created_at DESC, id DESC`. Thus every initial refresh and every cursor page scans and sorts the growing listings table before returning at most 101 rows, negating the scalability benefit of the new pagination and increasing D1 rows read; add an index/query shape that supports this moderation ordering.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
